    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633-a11">

                <pb facs="0757" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg671"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 8.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Algara to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Referring to my note of October
                    8 last, in which I informed your excellency that I had requested the governor of
                    the state of Jalisco to direct that more active measures be taken to procure the
                    arrest of one of the suspected murderers of Philip Nesdel, I have the honor to
                    transmit to your excellency, herewith, a copy of a communication addressed to me
                    by the said governor, in which he informs me of the present condition of the
                    case.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <p>In the absence of the secretary, the subsecretary,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José Algara.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
